WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.317
Where is your revenue stuck?

00:00:02.317 --> 00:00:05.117
Pipeline Schedule shows what’s late, who owns it,

00:00:05.117 --> 00:00:07.764
and the next step, so you close more this quarter.

00:00:07.764 --> 00:00:09.844
Product Overview flags the products that lose

00:00:09.844 --> 00:00:12.575
more than they win, so you can find out why.

00:00:12.575 --> 00:00:17.429
Close reasons shows the reasons your team recorded, and which ones are growing.

00:00:17.429 --> 00:00:19.069
So you know where to invest:

00:00:19.829 --> 00:00:22.303
pricing, positioning, or sales material.

00:00:22.303 --> 00:00:25.563
Team Performance shows each person’s late and stalled deals,

00:00:25.763 --> 00:00:28.168
so coaching starts with the right ones.

00:00:28.168 --> 00:00:32.040
Read-only, inside Salesforce, on your own fields.

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:37.008
Become a design partner at revenue.opsgs.com.
